"row","settings":{"benefit":"<strong>Mounts With A Bracket<\/strong>","us":true,"others":false,"others_2":false,"others_3":false}},"row_new_5th":{"type":"row","settings":{"benefit":"<strong>Adds To Your Existing Fire Kit<\/strong>","us":true,"others":false,"others_2":false,"others_3":false}}},"block_order":["row_ikpHXa","row_6g8cYJ","row_HBaXXR","row_new_4th","row_new_5th"],"custom_css":["tbody.isolate td {background-image: linear-gradient( 180deg, rgba(49, 115, 227, 0), rgba(000, 000, 000, 0.2) );}","tbody.isolate td.highlighted-cell {background-image: linear-gradient( 180deg, rgba(49, 115, 227, 0), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) );}",".comparison-table__row-name {width: 60%;}"],"name":"Comparison table","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"Don't Waste Money on Duplicates","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h2","text":"<p>See what a suppression pod adds inside a sealed panel<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"atc_button_label":"","atc_product":"","atc_skip_cart":false,"desktop_alignment":"left","mobile_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","layout":"table_second","style":"centered","corner_radius":20,"number_of_competitors":1,"us_label":"Riva collections","us_label_size":18,"logo_width":90,"mobile_logo_width":60,"others_label":"Nothing In The Cabinet","others_label_size":18,"others_logo_width":90,"others_mobile_logo_width":60,"others_2_label":"Competitor 2","others_2_label_size":18,"others_2_logo_width":90,"others_2_mobile_logo_width":60,"others_3_label":"Competitor 3","others_3_label_size":18,"others_3_logo_width":90,"others_3_mobile_logo_width":60,"checkmark_style":"regular","checkmark_color":"#ffffff","checkmark_bg_color":"#53af01","x_style":"regular","x_color":"#ff0000","x_bg_color":"#dbdbdb","opposite_icon_colors":"original","highlighted_color_scheme":"accent-1","highlighted_separator_opacity":0,"highlighted_overlay_opacity":0,"other_cells_color_scheme":"background-1","regular_separator_opacity":10,"regular_overlay_opacity":0,"minimalistic_border_opacity":16,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#2e2a39","custom_colors_solid_button_background":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_solid_button_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_outline_button":"#dd1d1d","custom_colors_highlighted_background":"#2e2a39","custom_colors_highlighted_text":"#ffffff","custom_colors_others_background":"#ffffff","custom_colors_others_text":"#2e2a39"}},"174375794036da818e":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"lai_product_reviews_lai_product_section_UFNLCk":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/lai-product-reviews\/blocks\/lai-product-section\/cad3c6c6-329e-4416-ba74-b79359b5b6e1","settings":{"lai_product":"","title":"","use_other_product":false}}},"block_order":["lai_product_reviews_lai_product_section_UFNLCk"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"include_margins":true}},"collapsible_content_EUY8hK":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"collapsible_row_q1":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Does This Make My Home Or Shop Fire-Safe?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>No, and please do not buy it thinking it does. This is a small device for a small sealed space — an electrical panel, a cabinet, an engine bay. It does nothing in an open room, a kitchen or a corridor, because the agent disperses instantly in open air. It is not a fire extinguisher, not a smoke alarm, and not a substitute for either. Every home and shop still needs working smoke alarms, an accessible extinguisher of the right class, and a way out.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q2":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What Do I Do If There Is A Fire?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Get everyone out, then call the fire brigade on 101. Do not wait to see whether the pod works, do not open the enclosure to look, and do not go back in for belongings. If this device does its job you will find out afterwards — it is not something to stand and watch.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"What Size Space Does It Cover?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>[FILL: publish the rated enclosed volume in cubic metres. This single number decides whether the product works or does nothing, and a buyer cannot judge placement without it. A pod rated for a small cabinet fitted in a large room is useless.]<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q4":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is The Discharge Harmful To Breathe?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>[FILL: do not repeat the supplier's \"safe and non-toxic\" line. Get the safety data sheet and state what it actually says.] Whatever the agent, treat a discharge as a reason to leave the space and ventilate it before going back in, and keep the pod out of enclosures where people work with their heads inside.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q5":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Does It Expire?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>[FILL: state the service life in years and confirm that an expiry date is printed on the unit.] \"Maintenance-free\" is not the same as permanent. Note the date when you fit it and replace it when it is due — an expired pod that everyone assumes still works is worse than no pod at all.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q6":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Where Should It Be Fitted?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>[FILL: give the supplier's mounting guidance — orientation, distance from the likely ignition point, and what it must not be fitted near.] Fit it inside the enclosure it is meant to protect, with the enclosure normally kept closed.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_q1","collapsible_row_q2","collapsible_row_q3","collapsible_row_q4","collapsible_row_q5","collapsible_row_q6"],"custom_css":[".collapsible-cont